💡 Key Insight:
 LSTMs make models context-aware, allowing them to capture patterns across long sequences. They’re behind features like predictive typing, chatbots, and sequence-based AI generation!

#Next Word Prediction using LSTM
I developed a Next Word Prediction model using LSTM (Long Short-Term Memory networks) in Python. This project demonstrates how RNNs can learn sequential dependencies in text and predict the most probable next word in a sentence.
💡 Key Highlights:
✅ Built using Python, TensorFlow, and Keras
🧠 Utilizes LSTM networks to capture long-term dependencies in text
🎯 Predicts next word in a sentence based on context
🛠 Can be extended to autocomplete, chatbots, and language modeling
🌐 Tech Stack:
 Python, TensorFlow, Keras, NumPy, NLP, RNN/LSTM

